OL,3,GNEWSASchool sorry after GP criticises
OL,4,Atoilets statement
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school has apologised after a GP
OL,7,Fcriticised it for telling parents of
OL,8,Fpupils to show a medical need for a
OL,9,Ftoilet pass.
OL,11,FSomercotes Academy, in North
OL,12,FSomercotes, Lincolnshire, wrote to
OL,13,Fparents and carers stating pupils who
OL,14,Fhad an existing pass should provide
OL,15,F"supporting medical evidence", such as
OL,16,Fdocumentation from an "appropriate
OL,17,Fhealthcare professional or recognised
OL,18,Fmedical provider".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
