OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1791285940
OL,1,W5j 5Quzj#5w;jp%p05 jj#57+
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASchool sorry after GP criticises
OL,4,Atoilets statement
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move drew criticism from Marsh
OL,7,FMedical Practice, a GP surgery, which
OL,8,Fsaid the use of a toilet was a "basic
OL,9,Fhealth and dignity need" and writing
OL,10,Fletters was not a good use of NHS time.
OL,12,FIn a statement to the BBC, school
OL,13,Fprincipal Katy Black said the letter
OL,14,Fwas sent in error and apologised "for
OL,15,Fthe confusion".
